// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
//  ZAFIRA TILI - C FFI (Foreign Function Interface) Namunasi
//  Fayl: examples/ffi_test.zf
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

import std.ffi

print("==================================================")
print("    ZAFIRA C FFI (std.ffi) IMKONIYATLARI SINOVI   ")
print("==================================================")

// ─── 1. STANDART C KUTUBXONASINI YUKLASH ───
print("\n>>> 1. Standart C kutubxonasini yuklash (libc / msvcrt) <<<")
let libc = ffi.load("libc")
print("Yuklangan kutubxona nomi: " + libc.name)

// Simvollarni tekshirish (has_symbol)
let has_abs = libc.has_symbol("abs")
let has_sqrt = libc.has_symbol("sqrt")
let has_puts = libc.has_symbol("puts")
let has_fake = libc.has_symbol("non_existent_symbol_xyz")

print("abs funksiyasi mavjudmi:  " + String(has_abs))
print("sqrt funksiyasi mavjudmi: " + String(has_sqrt))
print("puts funksiyasi mavjudmi: " + String(has_puts))
print("fake funksiyasi bormi:    " + String(has_fake))

// ─── 2. C MATEMATIK FUNKSIYALARINI CHAQIRISH ───
print("\n>>> 2. C Matematik funksiyalarini chaqirish <<<")

// 2.1 abs (int)
let manfiy_son = -123
let musbat_son = libc.call("abs", [manfiy_son], "int")
print("abs(-123) natijasi: " + String(musbat_son))

// 2.2 sqrt (float / double)
let kvadrat_ildiz = libc.call("sqrt", [144.0], "float")
print("sqrt(144.0) natijasi: " + String(kvadrat_ildiz))

// 2.3 pow (float / double)
let daraja = libc.call("pow", [2.0, 10.0], "float")
print("pow(2.0, 10.0) natijasi: " + String(daraja))

// ─── 3. C SATR VA I/O FUNKSIYALARINI CHAQIRISH ───
print("\n>>> 3. C Satr (String) va I/O funksiyalari <<<")

// 3.1 strlen
let matn = "Zafira C FFI moduli muvaffaqiyatli ishga tushdi!"
let uzunlik = libc.call("strlen", [matn], "int")
print("Satr uzunligi (strlen): " + String(uzunlik))

// 3.2 puts
print("C puts() orqali konsolga chiqarish:")
libc.call("puts", ["   -> Salom, bu C puts() funksiyasi orqali chiqarilgan matn!"])

// ─── 4. C TURLARI (c_int, c_float, c_string) BILAN ISHLASH ───
print("\n>>> 4. Maxsus C turlari bilan ishlash <<<")

let c_son = ffi.c_int(-999)
print("c_int turi: " + c_son.type + ", qiymati: " + String(c_son.value))
let abs_c = libc.call("abs", [c_son], "int")
print("abs(c_int(-999)): " + String(abs_c))

let c_haqiqiy = ffi.c_float(49.0)
print("c_float turi: " + c_haqiqiy.type + ", qiymati: " + String(c_haqiqiy.value))
let sqrt_c = libc.call("sqrt", [c_haqiqiy], "float")
print("sqrt(c_float(49.0)): " + String(sqrt_c))

let c_satr = ffi.c_string("O'zbekiston - Zafira FFI")
print("c_string turi: " + c_satr.type + ", qiymati: " + c_satr.value)
let len_c = libc.call("strlen", [c_satr], "int")
print("strlen(c_string): " + String(len_c))

// ─── 5. XATOLIKLARNI USHLASH (ERROR HANDLING) ───
print("\n>>> 5. Xatoliklarni ushlash (try / catch) <<<")

// 5.1 Mavjud bo'lmagan kutubxona
try {
    let topilmas_lib = ffi.load("mavjud_bolmagan_kutubxona_xyz123")
    print("XATO: Kutubxona topilmasligi kerak edi!")
} catch (xato1) {
    print("Kutubxona xatosi muvaffaqiyatli ushlandi: " + xato1)
}

// 5.2 Mavjud bo'lmagan funksiya
try {
    let natija_xato = libc.call("topilmas_funksiya_abc")
    print("XATO: Funksiya chaqirilmasligi kerak edi!")
} catch (xato2) {
    print("Funksiya topilmadi xatosi ushlandi: " + xato2)
}

print("\n==================================================")
print("   BARCHA C FFI TESTLARI MUVAFFAQIYATLI O'TDI!    ")
print("==================================================")
